% A Liana wallet: a primary key, or a recovery key after a delay
%
% The Logical English twin of a Bitcoin spending policy, written by the
% Miniscript translator. Who can spend the
% coin, when, and why: each rule is one spending path of the policy.
%
% Source: the Liana recovery guide
%         https://github.com/wizardsardine/liana/blob/master/doc/RECOVER.md
%
% The source, as written (cut into lines of 100 characters: join them for the text):
%     wsh(or_d(pk([a5c6b76e/48'/1'/0'/2']tpubDF5861hj6vR3iJr3aPjGJz4rNbqDCRujQ21mczzKT5SiedaQqNVgHC8HT9cey
%     xvMFRoPMx4P6HAcL3NZrUPhRUbwCyj3TKSa64bAfnE3sLh/<0;1>/*),and_v(v:pkh([c477fd13/48'/1'/0'/2']tpubDFn7i
%     PbFqGrTQ2aRACNsUK1MXQR4Z6dYfU2nD1WA9ifSaia642j3Wah4n5pBUEpERNWGJsyv3Dv5qwBabC9TLQrwSboKzukw9wmurGu7X
%     VH/<0;1>/*),older(3))))#8ldsjayd
%
% The source, laid out (keys and hashes by their role, <like this>):
%     wsh(
%       or_d(
%         pk(<the primary key>),
%         and_v(v:pkh(<the recovery key>),older(3))))
%
% The legend (role <- key or hash as written in the source):
%     the primary key  <- [a5c6b76e/48'/1'/0'/2']tpubDF5861hj6vR3iJr3aPjGJz4rNbqDCRujQ21mczzKT5SiedaQqNVgHC8HT9ceyxvMFRoPMx4P6HAcL3NZrUPhRUbwCyj3TKSa64bAfnE3sLh/<0;1>/*
%     the recovery key <- [c477fd13/48'/1'/0'/2']tpubDFn7iPbFqGrTQ2aRACNsUK1MXQR4Z6dYfU2nD1WA9ifSaia642j3Wah4n5pBUEpERNWGJsyv3Dv5qwBabC9TLQrwSboKzukw9wmurGu7XVH/<0;1>/*
%
% What it says (the spending policy, by BIP 379's semantics):
%     any one of these:
%       a signature by the primary key
%       all of these:
%         a signature by the recovery key
%         the coin at least 3 blocks old (about 30 minutes; older(3))
%
% Try it in Minsc (the policy compiled to Miniscript, Script and an address,
% in the browser): the document "the policy in Minsc" below.
%
