the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base liana_recovery includes these resources:
    temporal.

the templates are:
    the coin can be spent.
    the coin was confirmed in block *a height*; scenario element.
    the spending transaction is in block *a height*; scenario element.
    the coin has been confirmed for *a number* blocks.
    the witness contains a signature by *a key*; scenario element.
    the public key of *a key* is *a text*.

the knowledge base liana_recovery includes:

the Liana recovery guide is published at "https://github.com/wizardsardine/liana/blob/master/doc/RECOVER.md".
the text of the Liana recovery guide is at "sources/liana_recover.txt".

the policy in Minsc is published at "https://min.sc/#c=//%20A%20Liana%20wallet:%20a%20primary%20key,%20or%20a%20recovery%20key%20after%20a%20delay%0A//%20The%20Logical%20English%20twin's%20policy%20(the%20Miniscript%20translator%20of%20Logical%20English).%0A$primary_key%20=%20%5Ba5c6b76e/48'/1'/0'/2'%5DtpubDF5861hj6vR3iJr3aPjGJz4rNbqDCRujQ21mczzKT5SiedaQqNVgHC8HT9ceyxvMFRoPMx4P6HAcL3NZrUPhRUbwCyj3TKSa64bAfnE3sLh/0/*;%20%20%20//%20the%20primary%20key%20(as%20in%20the%20source)%0A$recovery_key%20=%20%5Bc477fd13/48'/1'/0'/2'%5DtpubDFn7iPbFqGrTQ2aRACNsUK1MXQR4Z6dYfU2nD1WA9ifSaia642j3Wah4n5pBUEpERNWGJsyv3Dv5qwBabC9TLQrwSboKzukw9wmurGu7XVH/0/*;%20%20%20//%20the%20recovery%20key%20(as%20in%20the%20source)%0A%0Aor(pk($primary_key),and(pk($recovery_key),older(3)))%0A".

